  <page_number>16</page_number>
  <running_head>Castigatio Paral.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Quod vero rem ipsam concernit</l>
    <l n="2">quis credat Calvinum symbolum Ni-</l>
    <l n="3">cenum contempsisse, qui duobus annis</l>
    <l n="4">antequam adversus Gentilem cala-</l>
    <l n="5">mum stringeret, anno nimirum 1561.</l>
    <l n="6">Confessioni Gallicæ subscripsit, in qua</l>
    <l n="7">art. 6. ista habet: <i>Deniq; in hoc mysterio</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>(Trinitatis) approbamus quod vetera ista</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>Concilia quatuor determinarunt, &amp; omnes</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>sectas à vetustis illis sanctis Doctoribus,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>veluti Athanasio, Hilario, Cyrillo, Ambro-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>sio &amp; cæteris ex verbo Dei damnatas, de-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>testamur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Si quid ergo divinare possum puto</l>
    <l n="15">Calvinum non de Symbolo Niceno</l>
    <l n="16">locutum, sed ipsum Petrum Caroli ver-</l>
    <l n="17">ba Symboli sæpe obiicientem, nec</l>
    <l n="18">recte percipientem, ineptum &amp; stul-</l>
    <l n="19">tum battologum appellasse.</l>
    <l n="20" para="true">Pergit Harscher: <i>Calvinus Filium Dei</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>esse proprie creatorem cœli &amp; terræ negat.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">Fides Calvini de hoc dogmate legitur</l>
    <l n="23">in coment. Joh. cap. 1. ad verba illa,</l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>omnia</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
</page>
